# IIQ Java File Placement

## Java source

| File type | Location | Example |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **REST resource** | `src/sailpoint/web/rest/` | `MetadataValidationResource.java` |
| **Service class** | `src/sailpoint/service/` | `MetadataValidationService.java` |
| **DTO / model** | `src/sailpoint/web/rest/dto/` | `ValidationResultDTO.java` |
| **Utility** | `src/sailpoint/tools/` | Only for truly generic utilities |
| **Configuration** | `src/sailpoint/object/` | SailPoint XML objects |

## Java tests

| Test type | Location | Mirrors |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **Java unit test** | `test/sailpoint/` | Mirrors `src/sailpoint/` |

## Properties / i18n

| File type | Location |
|-----------|----------|
| **Message keys** | `web/WEB-INF/classes/iiqMessages.properties` |
| **New keys** | Append at end of relevant section. Key format: `ui_{feature}_{component}_{action}` (see `iiq-naming-angularjs.mdc` for full rules) |
